From 40835d639f9586f414010750c3ecde144e735a55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sbihaiko <bihaiko@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:07:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] shader_recompiler: route unrouted 32-bit global atomics to
 bound storage buffers (off by default)

EDEN_NX2_GLOBAL_ATOMICS=1: a 32-bit global atomic the storage buffer pass
could not route walks the bound NVN storage buffers and runs on the word
that holds its address, instead of failing the whole pipeline. Port of
the fork's own earlier 0065 (Ocarina global reduction), SPIR-V part only.
